#!/bin/bash
# install.sh for the app "go-sync" - generated by app.sh from _templates_/go-sync/install.sh.template
# Prepares directories and the DynamoDB init files BEFORE Komodo builds and
# deploys the stack. go-sync needs no secrets.
set -euo pipefail

SPRW__CUSTOMER="!!CUSTOMER!!"
SPRW__STACKNAME="!!STACKNAME!!"
SPRW__APPDOMAIN="!!APPDOMAIN!!"
SPRW__DATA_DIR="!!DATA_DIR!!"
SPRW__COMPOSE_DIR="!!COMPOSE_DIR!!"
TEMPLATE_DIR="/opt/docker/_templates_/go-sync"

echo "Preparing go-sync ${SPRW__STACKNAME} (${SPRW__APPDOMAIN}) ..."

missing=0
for v in SPRW__CUSTOMER SPRW__STACKNAME SPRW__APPDOMAIN SPRW__DATA_DIR SPRW__COMPOSE_DIR; do
    val="${!v}"
    if [ -z "$val" ] || [[ "$val" == *'!!'* ]]; then
        echo "ERROR: $v is not set (placeholder unresolved)." >&2
        missing=1
    fi
done
[ "$missing" -eq 0 ] || exit 1

# shellcheck source=/opt/docker/_scripts_/ensure-networks.sh
source /opt/docker/_scripts_/ensure-networks.sh
ensure_shared_networks

mkdir -p "$SPRW__COMPOSE_DIR/init" "$SPRW__DATA_DIR/dynamodb"
cp -a "$TEMPLATE_DIR/dynamodb-init.sh" "$SPRW__COMPOSE_DIR/init/dynamodb-init.sh"
cp -a "$TEMPLATE_DIR/dynamodb-table.json" "$SPRW__COMPOSE_DIR/init/dynamodb-table.json"
chmod 755 "$SPRW__COMPOSE_DIR/init/dynamodb-init.sh"
# amazon/dynamodb-local runs as dynamodblocal (uid 1000)
chown -R 1000:1000 "$SPRW__DATA_DIR/dynamodb"

echo "Installation prepared. Komodo builds go-sync from the upstream repo on the first deploy."
{%- if PATH_PROTECT == "true" %}
echo "Brave (desktop): start with --sync-url=https://${SPRW__APPDOMAIN}/<ACCESS_PATH>/v2"
echo "  <ACCESS_PATH> is SPRW_GOSYNC_ACCESS_PATH in the persistent config (not printed here)."
{%- elif PATH_PROTECT == "false" %}
echo "Brave (desktop): start with --sync-url=https://${SPRW__APPDOMAIN}/v2"
{%- endif %}
